1769712697245376	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzAw		item.create	bn-bcc3f2c18	{"description":"Allow botty wait to combine stability check with pattern matching.\n\nCurrent:\n  botty wait id --stable 200          # OR\n  botty wait id --contains \"Done.\"\n\nDesired:\n  botty wait id --stable 200 --contains \"Done.\"\n\nWait for screen to be stable (unchanged for 200ms) AND contain the pattern. Useful for waiting for prompts to fully render before proceeding.\n\n## Triage Notes (2026-01-29)\n**Complexity**: Low - Just remove clap's group=\"condition\" constraint and change from if-else to AND logic.\n**Implementation**: main.rs:642-707, ~1-2 hours\n**Value**: High - Eliminates race conditions in tests, common \"stable prompt\" pattern\n**Upgrade**: P3→P2 due to small scope + clear value\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nImplemented in commit 5bbfb8e. Removed clap group constraint and changed wait condition logic from if-else to AND. Now supports combining --stable, --contains, and --pattern. Example: 'botty wait id --stable 200 --contains prompt' waits for stable AND contains. Test added, all tests pass.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\nec642d383a117f660f75bfb054e4c34525a9bc407db2522cbce651d07ef73324\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"task","title":"Support combined wait conditions (--stable + --contains)"}	blake3:6XS2tgALgqfHBpbLXQTln5_M04ypM0VBUyWuhL6NWGs
