1770393996053873	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuAQ		item.create	bn-b0ceaed1e	{"description":"Currently `kill` sends SIGKILL by default, with `--term` for SIGTERM. This is backwards — every other tool defaults to SIGTERM. Change: default to SIGTERM (graceful), add `--force`/`-f` for SIGKILL, remove `--term` flag (now redundant). The protocol already defaults to SIGTERM (signal 15); the CLI is the only place hardcoding 9. Breaking change but correct behavior.\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nImplemented: kill now sends SIGTERM by default. Added --force/-f for SIGKILL. Removed --term flag.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\nf90a14847b3f7a56e56991e4402edb5aefe46e0ce57a0a101fe8147625d33d20\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\nowner:\nbotty-dev\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"task","title":"Make kill default to SIGTERM, add --force for SIGKILL"}	blake3:rAIdgG8SbvFWAumSQzav5ljBZ_0pu8wYh4KGRwLV8W0
1770394732136381	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuAg	blake3:rAIdgG8SbvFWAumSQzav5ljBZ_0pu8wYh4KGRwLV8W0	item.move	bn-b0ceaed1e	{"reason":"Imported from beads","state":"done"}	blake3:mEKDDECSlU74wD37ARc9rVE5hLoshrNEjr1Dh0Pe7tw
