1769380130101067	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzHw		item.create	bn-b4c90c0eb	{"description":"When using 'botty tail --replay', the snapshot output doesn't include a trailing newline, causing the first streamed line to concatenate with the last snapshot line.\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nAdded newline after snapshot if content doesn't end with one\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\ne1a54123b733827a4b411ca0f074cc5593047254b1ec57177240bc096ef0db3d\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"bug","title":"Fix --replay missing newline between snapshot and stream"}	blake3:38GmK7Wb8S6nTbG-1xge1WHceJF9zCxiK7CRJBNrLTg
