1769712717601968	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzMw		item.create	bn-b6d58c501	{"description":"Add built-in assertion commands to make test failures clearer and more idiomatic.\n\n## Problem\nCurrently using `botty snapshot | grep -q ...` which:\n- Gives poor error messages on failure\n- Requires shell pipes and external tools\n- Doesn't show what was actually found vs expected\n\n## Proposed solution\n```bash\nbotty assert <agent-id> --contains \"Done.\" --timeout 10\nbotty assert <agent-id> --pattern \"\\d+ tasks completed\"\nbotty assert <agent-id> --not-contains \"Error\"\n```\n\n## Behavior\n- Exit code 0 if assertion passes\n- Exit code 1 if assertion fails\n- Print clear error message showing expected vs actual on failure\n- Support timeout (like wait command)\n\n## Implementation notes\nSimilar to existing wait command (main.rs:642-707). Can reuse polling logic.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `botty assert <id> --contains <text>` passes if text in output\n- [ ] `botty assert <id> --not-contains <text>` passes if text NOT in output\n- [ ] `botty assert <id> --pattern <regex>` passes if regex matches\n- [ ] `--timeout <seconds>` waits for condition (default: fail immediately)\n- [ ] Clear error message on failure showing what was expected vs found\n- [ ] Exit code 0 on success, 1 on failure\n\n## Labels\ntesting, cli\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nCompleted in commit eaa31d26. Added assert command with --contains, --not-contains, --pattern flags. Clear error messages on failure showing expected vs actual. Exit code 0 on pass, 1 on fail.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n9ad7d109d6816c04081094c29c3652cd1b258d133308ab792f555598a187e385\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"task","title":"Add assertion commands for testing"}	blake3:FMrK79DxL1vyJ_PLtxUe4OTtr_dYilzn3CXcYENBPas
1769875414781174	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzNA	blake3:FMrK79DxL1vyJ_PLtxUe4OTtr_dYilzn3CXcYENBPas	item.move	bn-b6d58c501	{"reason":"Imported from beads","state":"done"}	blake3:VQV6Sa03WjE7j7zI3scc1zABK6Bw5thZ4gX-imFmDuo
