1769374988873438	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzNw		item.create	bn-bc4f69e48	{"description":"Agents can emit __BOTTY_MSG:{json}__ markers. Orchestrator retrieves via 'botty recv <id>'. Enables agents to communicate structured data back.\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nWon't implement - botbus provides this functionality already (send, history, watch, inbox). Explicit botbus calls are cleaner than parsing markers from stdout.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\ne42ab9a073b96ac53f28ad56f80ec30006e369ac14261c35470f38fc12c90d2d\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"task","title":"Structured agent messaging protocol"}	blake3:zi7x7F9HkOL616iOktYsFclZ2Y-tP6npT2NVcOgEOK8
