1770654326531652	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuEg		item.create	bn-bd57d0eec	{"description":"Migrate `botty list` from toon/json/text to the new OutputFormat system.\n\n## Changes\n- Replace --format toon/json/text with text/json/pretty\n- Drop toon_format dependency from this command\n- JSON output: wrap in `{ \"agents\": [...], \"advice\": [\"botty kill <id>\", ...] }`\n- Text output: ID-first, two-space delimiters, no header row, suggested next command\n- Pretty output: colored table like current text but with formatting\n- Remove deprecated --json flag\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `botty list --format json` returns envelope with agents[] and advice[]\n- [ ] `botty list --format text` returns ID-first compact records\n- [ ] `botty list --format pretty` returns colored human-friendly table\n- [ ] Default is TTY-detected (pretty for terminal, text for pipe)\n- [ ] --json deprecated flag still works (maps to --format json)\n\n## Testing\n- Build and run `botty list` in both TTY and piped contexts\n- Verify JSON envelope structure with jq\n- Verify text output is grep-friendly\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nMerged. List command migrated to text/json/pretty with JSON envelope.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\nbf87b0ad5d765d4f165e723eb9dd096041be9c9de90e13eb29eb2ec489f90a5b\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\nowner:\nbotty-dev\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"task","title":"Update botty list to use OutputFormat and JSON envelope"}	blake3:8Z10fG0OVi6an-51VooGgXCG_7p3BqwIfu_RFjErPUc
