1769359125427512	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzTQ		item.create	bn-b575c869e	{"description":"In run_attach_bridge(), pty_fd is captured at attach start but the agent could be removed while the bridge is running. After drop(mgr), the fd may become invalid on next iteration. Need Arc<OwnedFd> or verify agent exists after each lock acquisition.\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nFixed by always acquiring lock before using PTY fd, never passing raw fd across async boundaries\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n38a0f87200f7634520e690771e6f9b2a0d9f3d31c7cd04dc2f01c302652e2748\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"bug","title":"Fix FD lifetime issue in attach bridge - potential use-after-free"}	blake3:0DeVAPBAXtRosPNVrD8cDKy5D9ytqsFWTeoCXCTXxOk
