1769382904538250	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzTw		item.create	bn-b4301d39d	{"description":"The event loop in run_view_event_loop creates a fresh TmuxView with empty active_panes. This causes: (1) new agents to replace existing panes instead of adding, (2) session to close when any agent exits because is_empty() returns true. Need to initialize event loop with existing agent IDs.\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nPass existing agent IDs to event loop and initialize tracking with mark_pane_exists()\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n449c7eab83b263081731d640a017b68c1f2d48ed545d7b65abdb30b33a426a55\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"bug","title":"View event loop doesn't track existing panes"}	blake3:arO9tBPw4fASTouPuc3P8RP-c_dJVj9O-ccg4yufIjs
