1769712689764438	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzUw		item.create	bn-baba56177	{"description":"Epic: Record manual sessions and generate test scripts.\n\n## Vision\nDramatically speed up test authoring by recording manual interactions and generating executable test scripts.\n\n## Breakdown\nThis epic has been split into:\n1. **bd-3r3**: Add basic command recording - Track commands sent to agents\n2. **bd-3l8**: Generate test scripts from recordings - Convert logs to bash scripts\n3. **Future**: Replay mode (not yet created) - Execute recorded scripts\n\n## Current Status\nStart with bd-3r3 to prove the recording infrastructure, then move to bd-3l8 for script generation.\n\n## Original vision\n```bash\nbotty record <agent-id>\n# ... manually interact ...\nbotty stop-recording <agent-id> > test-script.sh\n```\n\nOptional replay:\n```bash\nbotty replay <agent-id> test-script.sh\n```\n\n## Note\nConsider closing this epic once subtasks are complete, or keep it open to track the overall feature.\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nEpic complete. Recording (bd-3r3) and script generation (bd-3l8) both merged.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\nb6b18913199b4b725468626744f23ec11054c539deb8481c3bd172edef2cc413\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"goal","title":"Add record/replay mode for test authoring"}	blake3:RWkUstGam19t-RexFkMt6SdB6rKg62oXsSWjVZPhHzE
