1770650129943456	botbox-dev	itc:v3:AWLJPJJM5nmSc0AAAAAAQdXqrdvauwAAAAEwAQ		item.create	bn-bd7d8dc52	{"description":"Epic: Adopt CLI output conventions from botbox v0.5.0 across all botty commands.\n\nSee .agents/botbox/design/cli-conventions.md for the full spec.\n\n## Key changes\n1. **Format infrastructure**: Shared OutputFormat enum (text/json/pretty) with TTY auto-detection (--format flag > FORMAT env > TTY→pretty / non-TTY→text)\n2. **JSON envelope**: All JSON output wrapped in named objects with advice[] field\n3. **Text format**: ID-first records, two-space delimiters, no prose, suggested next commands\n4. **Pretty format**: Colored, human-friendly output for TTY (replaces current default)\n5. **Drop toon**: Remove toon_format dependency; text is sufficient for agents\n\n## Commands to update\n- `botty list` — currently has toon/json/text; needs json envelope, pretty default\n- `botty dump` — currently text/jsonl\n- `botty snapshot` — currently raw/jsonl\n- `botty spawn/kill/send/etc` — ad-hoc println, needs consistent text + json output\n- `botty doctor` — already close to conventions\n- `botty recording/gen-test` — new commands, should adopt from the start\n\n## Broken down into subtasks (see dependencies).\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nEpic complete. All subtasks merged: OutputFormat module (bd-zzz), list migration (bd-2el), other commands (bd-1w6), toon removal (bd-m4k).\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n14d8170307df84dc264b6e6b9426bfe192cc820cbad8352557a4e618c83a4a87\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"goal","title":"Adopt CLI output conventions: JSON envelope, drop TOON, add pretty format"}	blake3:VD-oEtLgjNj6AsyRBu_tKxliN3y8V9wyIJUtlp0LPNU
1770656205886651	botbox-dev	itc:v3:AWLJPJJM5nmSc0AAAAAAQdXqrdvauwAAAAEwAg	blake3:VD-oEtLgjNj6AsyRBu_tKxliN3y8V9wyIJUtlp0LPNU	item.move	bn-bd7d8dc52	{"reason":"Imported from beads","state":"done"}	blake3:ZIK99JEMI2JxstTsdktwC6Y4DM8wY65iorYOAgf3QLQ
