1769382203835428	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzfQ		item.create	bn-b351ff7ec	{"description":"When viewing TUI programs like htop/btop via 'botty view' (which uses tail --replay), the initial screen shows correctly but updates don't render properly. The snapshot outputs rendered text without cursor positioning, then streaming raw escape codes don't align correctly. Need to either: (A) stream periodic snapshots, or (B) stream raw transcript from start and let TUI codes rebuild screen.\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nFixed by returning full transcript from Tail instead of truncated 4KB chunk. Replay now dumps full transcript and streaming compares correctly.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n18b5173d1f8323372e257b56ba2528ae34ad1896613c8fe5f9ee438e6a1c443e\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"bug","title":"TUIs don't update in view/tail --replay"}	blake3:1LxXCY5OIoqzOG71kUb-pg7sC1emJ3-9lpnIsPtsTu8
