1770235754968820	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuGQ		item.create	bn-bac43aa1b	{"description":"## Problem\nWhen spawning agents without `--env`, environment variables set in the calling shell are not inherited by the spawned agent.\n\n## Reproduction\n```bash\nexport TEST_VAR=\"hello\"\nbotty spawn --name test -- sh -c 'echo TEST_VAR=$TEST_VAR'\nbotty snapshot test\n# Shows: TEST_VAR=  (empty)\n```\n\n## Root Cause\nThe botty server is started as a separate background process when first needed. Spawned agents inherit the server's environment (captured at server startup time), not the client's current environment.\n\nThis is because:\n1. Client connects to server via Unix socket\n2. `Request::Spawn` is sent over socket\n3. Server forks to create agent\n4. Agent inherits server's env, not client's env\n\n## Impact\n- Blocking botbox workflows that expect env inheritance\n- Users must use explicit `--env VAR=value` for every variable they need\n- Counter-intuitive behavior vs. direct process spawning\n\n## Options\n1. **Transmit client env in Spawn request** (adds bandwidth, privacy/security considerations)\n2. **Selective inheritance** - transmit specific vars (BOTBUS_AGENT, EDITOR, etc.)\n3. **Document as limitation** - require explicit --env (current behavior)\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Spawned agents see env vars from calling client\n- [ ] Security: don't transmit sensitive vars by default (or make opt-in)\n- [ ] Document behavior\n\n## Labels\nspawn, environment, bug, blocking\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nResolved: agents inherit server env (not client env) by design. Explicit --env KEY=VALUE flag provides secure selective inheritance. No env vars pass through by default.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n783249da04ba23baf0303a00935628bbb4121892c3fd3c476a899f6a8a18eb68\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\nowner:\nbotty-dev\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"bug","title":"Spawned agents don't inherit client environment variables"}	blake3:Zm9GMgp79gwZbWIJdlwPUHLUggM0--M1Cy0EjDZrfRI
1770392875167881	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuGg	blake3:Zm9GMgp79gwZbWIJdlwPUHLUggM0--M1Cy0EjDZrfRI	item.move	bn-bac43aa1b	{"reason":"Imported from beads","state":"done"}	blake3:7eCmJYQmQDLGsMM4y1RNBF2bWuLI3L14DE0uaf1vQL4
