1769874493375727	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzkQE		item.create	bn-b49bed36e	{"description":"Convert recorded command sessions into executable test scripts.\n\n## Goal\nTake the JSON recording from bd-3r3 and generate a runnable bash test script.\n\n## Implementation\n- New command: `botty gen-test <agent-id> > test.sh`\n- Reads recording from server\n- Outputs bash script with:\n  - Spawn command\n  - All send/send-keys with timing delays\n  - Snapshot assertions at key points\n  - Cleanup (kill agent)\n\n## Example output:\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nset -e\nAGENT=$(botty spawn -- bash)\nsleep 0.5\nbotty send-keys $AGENT e c h o space h i enter\nsleep 0.3\nbotty snapshot $AGENT | grep -q 'hi'\nbotty kill $AGENT\n```\n\n## Acceptance criteria:\n- [ ] `botty gen-test <agent-id>` outputs valid bash script\n- [ ] Generated script is executable and passes\n- [ ] Timing delays are reasonable (not too fast/slow)\n- [ ] Script includes comments explaining what's being tested\n\n## Dependencies\nDepends on: bd-3r3 (need recording infrastructure first)\n\nPart of: bd-2lj breakdown\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nMerged. Added gen-test command with shell escaping, timing delays, and 18 unit tests.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n46ce448d406442fac5772a974d3a8a928242acbe880df3b8977632c7bd716c77\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\nowner:\nbotty-dev\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"task","title":"Generate test scripts from recorded sessions"}	blake3:3J1371TDMCKYyL59_AN_WL9d4kY5j7T7yJLoR73GDdI
