1770780482651864	botbox-dev	itc:v3:AWLJPJJM5nmSc0AAAAAAQdXqrdvauwAAAAEwAw		item.create	bn-b3ad37a4e	{"description":"Agents frequently guess --json before discovering --format json (e.g. botty list --json). Add --json as a hidden alias (accepted silently, not shown in --help). This is now a standardized convention in the botbox CLI design guidelines.\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nImplemented in v0.12.2. Added --json as hidden alias for --format json on spawn, list, kill, send, send-bytes, send-keys, and recording commands.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n8038390520bad3156236a42e487d37269cb720d815d2e435ab6cedee5f43750d\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\nowner:\nbotty-dev\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"task","title":"Add --json as hidden alias for --format json"}	blake3:xxjNdzYb7nYbMrbOmCbAXu6ZZeKf8svDSkxO9yWvAb8
