1769712703797943	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzmwE		item.create	bn-b5b4ee8e4	{"description":"Add command to show only what changed between snapshots, making test verification easier.\n\n## Problem\nWhen testing, often want to verify 'this one thing changed and nothing else'.\nCurrently requires:\n- Taking snapshot\n- Comparing manually or with external diff\n- Visual inspection of full output\n\n## Proposed solution\nOption 1: New subcommand\n```bash\nbotty snapshot-diff <agent-id> <previous-snapshot-file>\n```\n\nOption 2: Flag on snapshot\n```bash\nbotty snapshot <agent-id> --diff <previous-snapshot-file>\n```\n\n## Output\nUnified diff format showing what changed, or 'No changes' if identical.\n\n## Implementation\n- Use existing snapshot infrastructure\n- Add diff library (e.g., similar_asserts, diff crate)\n- ~1-2 hours of work\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `botty snapshot <id> --diff <file>` shows unified diff\n- [ ] Exit code 0 if snapshots identical, 1 if different\n- [ ] Output is colorized (if terminal supports it)\n- [ ] Works with both regular and --raw snapshot formats\n- [ ] Clear message if previous snapshot file doesn't exist\n\n## Concerns/Notes\n- May have false positives from timing indicators or cursor position\n- Could also just use external diff, but built-in is more convenient\n- Upgrading to P2 since it's very easy and immediately useful\n\n## Labels\ntesting, cli\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nCompleted in commit eaa31d26. Added --diff flag to snapshot command to show unified diff between snapshots. Exit code 0 if identical, 1 if different.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n1b1ef7fd468f353cf0cf713e793116f284256677250de392e3162edab05d50e2\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"task","title":"Add snapshot diff command"}	blake3:jLAPH30Ukxh6W8dEdA9rs-6dLkEwWVnNEM5ABSJKBzo
1769875413706148	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEznAE	blake3:jLAPH30Ukxh6W8dEdA9rs-6dLkEwWVnNEM5ABSJKBzo	item.move	bn-b5b4ee8e4	{"reason":"Imported from beads","state":"done"}	blake3:q6_EbrvMUxzlVGiXS9tooXQf-kCxSIc5bqTzUE84rNI
1769874478849405	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEznQE		item.create	bn-b65e4fa9f	{"description":"First step toward test script generation: add ability to record commands sent to an agent.\n\n## Goal\nTrack all send/send-keys/snapshot commands issued to a specific agent during its lifetime.\n\n## Implementation\n- Add recording flag to Agent struct in server\n- When recording enabled, log commands to in-memory buffer\n- Provide Request::GetRecording to retrieve the log\n\n## Acceptance criteria:\n- [ ] `botty spawn --record -- bash` enables recording for that agent\n- [ ] All send/send-keys commands are captured with timestamps\n- [ ] Can retrieve recording via new command: `botty recording <agent-id>`\n- [ ] Output is structured (JSON) for later script generation\n\n## Non-goals\n- Script generation (that's bd-2lj-gen)\n- Replay functionality (that's bd-2lj-replay)\n- Output formatting besides JSON\n\nBlocks: bd-2lj-gen (script generation needs this)\nPart of: bd-2lj breakdown\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nMerged. Adds --record flag to spawn and botty recording command.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\nb62015a33361b163046c0be6b20f27b1ea129539fcac9e8d4f8a2cd7089cff34\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\nowner:\nbotty-dev\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"task","title":"Add basic command recording to agents"}	blake3:NsimHsOxD4U9OPxrizk145VRSZcB4UXI2BmCDKUVOiQ
