1769556892923229	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEznwE		item.create	bn-b0cf3fa2e	{"description":"When transitioning from the 'Waiting for agents...' placeholder to an active pane, the new pane doesn't take up the full window.\n\nShould trigger a resize or retile when replacing the placeholder with a real agent pane.\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nEvent loop now retiles after transitioning from placeholder to first real pane.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n762c371e6372eeb4b5a3e1ea635262f44b9f1276c5a7ce769901e49d05bf2d65\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"bug","title":"Trigger resize when transitioning from placeholder to active pane"}	blake3:rGZdjTJ_La9VvzsJrDIGqa_Wu3HJdjxo9fkcCyzhO50
