1769799284313799	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzpQE		item.create	bn-bc69ff188	{"description":"When detaching from the botty tmux view session with no agents running, the server and tmux session should be cleaned up automatically. Currently this cleanup doesn't happen — the server keeps running and the tmux session persists.\n\nNOT a regression from --proc changes — git history shows this cleanup was never implemented. The post-detach code in run_view_command() (main.rs ~line 1384) only unbinds Ctrl+P and aborts the event loop. It never checks for running agents or performs cleanup.\n\nImplementation notes:\n- After view.attach() returns (user detached), query the server for running agents\n- If no running agents: send Request::Shutdown and kill the tmux session\n- The TmuxView is moved into spawn_blocking, so either clone the session name beforehand or use tmux kill-session directly\n- If agents ARE running, leave everything alone (user can reattach later)\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- [ ] Detaching from botty view with 0 running agents shuts down the server\n- [ ] The tmux session is killed on detach when no agents are running\n- [ ] Normal detach with running agents still works as before (no shutdown)\n- [ ] Reattach after detach-with-agents still works\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nCompleted in commit 6cbd44d8. Implemented auto-cleanup: when detaching from view with no running agents, server shuts down and tmux session is killed. With agents running, server and session remain active for reattach. Manual testing required (documented in commit).\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n4265ad4778eeb81dd070f432afe190e43f9d89c6f0bc8f3f93d4dbaa5cc7743a\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"bug","title":"view: detaching from tmux with no agents should shut down server and kill session"}	blake3:vqe7NWkCxoyiMy4fC_PgwFxrz_biz7jPFiMLxyyUlew
1769876957283953	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzpgE	blake3:vqe7NWkCxoyiMy4fC_PgwFxrz_biz7jPFiMLxyyUlew	item.move	bn-bc69ff188	{"reason":"Imported from beads","state":"done"}	blake3:vrImpLCsN5eDmou771RlYhKqkaePzsJbeUJugGWX2_0
