1769712710344309	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzxQE		item.create	bn-bf1f3ff9e	{"description":"botty kill exits non-zero when agent already exited, requiring '|| true' in scripts.\n\nOptions:\n1. Add --if-running flag: only kill if agent exists, no-op otherwise\n2. Add wait-exit command: wait for clean exit with timeout\n3. Make kill idempotent (exit 0 if agent not found)\n\nExample:\n  botty kill --if-running test-agent\n  botty wait-exit test-agent --timeout 5\n\nMakes cleanup in test scripts cleaner.\n\n## Triage Notes (2026-01-29)\n**Complexity**: Low - main.rs:373-397, just change error handling\n**Recommendation**: Option 2 (idempotent) - exit 0 if \"agent not found\", still error on other failures\n**Value**: Common cleanup pattern, matches Unix tools (rm -f, pkill)\n**Implementation**: ~1 hour\n**Upgrade**: P3→P2 (quick win, common pain point)\n\nImported beads fields:\nclose_reason:\nImplemented in commit 5a27637. The kill command now exits with code 0 when agent not found, matching Unix tool behavior (rm -f, pkill). Added comprehensive CLI test to verify idempotent behavior. All tests pass.\n\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n292cfbae994561e52cc87f607f8109ee609cff3035f3c6b904816c22ec2b4617\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n.","kind":"task","title":"Improve botty kill exit handling"}	blake3:7BPE9G15sSixwWEbuBoSJiBKlWBdC1984HJqsf-zPV0
1769715841311606	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEzxgE	blake3:7BPE9G15sSixwWEbuBoSJiBKlWBdC1984HJqsf-zPV0	item.move	bn-bf1f3ff9e	{"reason":"Imported from beads","state":"done"}	blake3:UpRrK2kRFvDzHm9jk5Jv1IDDktYNxVwIv-pBPfouBLk
