1771948032263081	bones-dev	itc:v3:AWKSZJkkk5JkmZMxAAAAQatWqrq1bWwAAAE3AQ		item.create	bn-3i3	{"description":"botty snapshot <id> returns empty output (exit 0, no content) unless botty dump <id> is called first. After calling dump, snapshot works correctly. Repro: spawn an agent, wait, call snapshot (empty), call dump (works), call snapshot again (now works). Expected: snapshot should work without needing dump first.","kind":"bug","size":"s","title":"snapshot returns empty unless botty dump is called first"}	blake3:5t36gMD2b1DruNc0WMxQRmTwg2qKOmT1l0XpjY1AN30
1772026646604676	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEz1QE		item.create	bn-n2d	{"kind":"task","labels":["tail"],"size":"xs","title":"tail -n should also support --lines"}	blake3:9nj9SwrKQ9nRRDHEZWnjZIo2lpULMF_wkAueaijVwxQ
1772036192633488	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEz1gE		item.update	bn-b9cd0d1fd	{"field":"title","value":"Support unique tmux session names per view instance"}	blake3:8_vXViToHvjbHCJJq-qQZj_FwtR51FQiwwgpPRMaZoM
1772036192648432	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEz1wE		item.update	bn-b9cd0d1fd	{"field":"description","value":"Allow multiple botty view instances to run simultaneously without interfering.\n\n## Problem\nThe tmux session name is hardcoded as 'botty', which means:\n- Can't run multiple view instances\n- Multiple users on same machine would conflict\n- Reattaching might grab wrong session\n\n## Proposed solutions\n1. Generate unique session names (e.g., 'botty-<pid>' or 'botty-<uuid>')\n2. Add --session flag to specify custom name\n3. Both: generate by default, allow override\n\n## Implementation notes\nFrom security review cr-klwd (th-grfz). Low security impact, mainly a usability issue.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Multiple `botty view` instances can run simultaneously\n- [ ] Each gets unique tmux session name\n- [ ] Session names are discoverable (maybe `botty view --list`?)\n- [ ] Can specify custom session name with `--session`\n- [ ] Default naming is predictable (e.g., botty-<pid>)\n\n## Labels\nview, tmux, enhancement\n\nImported beads fields:\ncompaction_level:\n0\n\ncontent_hash:\n20e96c411ece4a02c7ea8e0c6509a920169a2ff77340127b023dbf9311396535\n\nephemeral:\n0\n\nis_template:\n0\n\noriginal_size:\n0\n\npinned:\n0\n\nsource_repo:\n."}	blake3:c7Kj_osc3TtJ01xp21A6bVf0haRZFKgODR9LgI1kpHk
1772036192657332	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEz2AE		item.update	bn-b9cd0d1fd	{"field":"kind","value":"task"}	blake3:aDg40KMqFjiyNHZTQajs5p2rZL5NmHeAK1ov5M6HnX0
1772036192665698	bob	itc:v3:AWKSc8kyZJPJk5EAAAAAQau9WtV610AAAAEz2QE		item.update	bn-b9cd0d1fd	{"field":"size","value":null}	blake3:EH_NWV8TJjwf0RR6SSbJ7JWBLgjFkDDdKGTc6cqSruE
