1772046255327047	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuKg		item.create	bn-2lm	{"description":"Rename the project from 'botty' to 'vessel' as part of the pseudo-religious/apocalyptic tool suite rebrand. This touches: Cargo.toml (package name), binary name, socket path defaults, tmux session name, all user-facing strings/help text, AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md references, test assertions, and the GitHub repo name. Coordinate with botbox (edict) and botbus (rite) renames.","kind":"task","size":"m","title":"Rename botty to vessel"}	blake3:EJT7J4ICH7njgI9jYs-lBi0k_IysEEC2DgCd8zq7Ito
