1772150801818893	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuKw		item.create	bn-hne	{"description":"Read /proc/<pid>/environ for a running agent and display its actual environment variables. This is critical for debugging env var passthrough issues (e.g. verifying CARGO_BUILD_JOBS reaches cargo). Should support --format json/text. For exited agents, return an error explaining the env is no longer available.","kind":"task","labels":["feature"],"title":"Add 'botty env <id>' command to show agent runtime environment"}	blake3:MOgrPAP53Wmx_Z9Hj-UImamOVQgVy2VVRtfakB9BwE4
1772150805515340	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuLA		item.create	bn-ocq	{"description":"Read /proc/<pid>/stat (or /proc/<pid>/status for VmRSS) for each agent and include memory usage in botty list output. For text format, show a human-readable column (e.g. '142M'). For JSON format, include rss_bytes field. Should also walk child process tree (/proc/<pid>/children or /proc/<pid>/task) to include memory from child processes (rustc, cargo, etc). Add an optional --stats flag to show aggregate totals (total RSS across all agents).","kind":"task","labels":["feature"],"title":"Show per-agent RSS memory usage in 'botty list'"}	blake3:sf6xv9gOOlyK2igzxDOjQRNdBv2RYDaR0RZCf0RpH_k
1772150810460354	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuLQ		item.create	bn-szm	{"description":"Add --memory-limit <size> flag (e.g. 4G, 512M) to botty spawn. On Linux with systemd, wrap the spawned command in 'systemd-run --user --scope -p MemoryMax=<limit> -p MemorySwapMax=0' so the agent and all its children (cargo, rustc, etc) are constrained. When the limit is hit, only the cgroup is killed, not the whole system. Also add --default-memory-limit to botty server so all agents get a default limit unless overridden. Platform fallbacks: Linux without systemd could try direct cgroup2 fs writes; macOS should warn and continue without limits. This prevents OOM from killing the terminal/tmux when multiple agents run heavy builds in parallel.","kind":"task","labels":["feature"],"title":"Add --memory-limit flag to botty spawn using cgroup scoping"}	blake3:N5SqdQwW6AurfcLSMXR3tuMkcPJduMgUpoAqz6jlAiU
1772150814938193	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuLg		item.move	bn-hne	{"state":"doing"}	blake3:pypMr-Ge5ovbK9UmJNh-qRF5pcY0HTOABYUss8q98Ag
