1772159804841692	botbox-dev	itc:v3:AWLJPJJM5nmSc0AAAAAAQdXqrdvauwAAAAEwBQ		item.create	bn-p7r	{"description":"Add W3C TRACEPARENT context propagation to botty so that spawn/kill/tail operations appear as child spans in distributed traces.\n\n## Background\n\nbotbox has a working telemetry stack:\n- `tracing` crate for instrumentation, `tracing-subscriber` for fan-out\n- `tracing-opentelemetry` bridges tracing spans → OTLP traces\n- `opentelemetry-appender-tracing` bridges tracing events → OTLP logs\n- OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT env var controls activation (unset=noop, stderr=JSON, http://...=OTLP)\n- Feature-gated behind `otel` cargo feature (default=on)\n- Fully synchronous: `reqwest-blocking-client`, `with_simple_exporter` — no tokio needed\n\n## TRACEPARENT propagation (the key part)\n\nWhen `TRACEPARENT` env var is set (W3C format: `00-{traceId}-{spanId}-{flags}`):\n1. `telemetry::init()` calls `install_parent_context()` which parses TRACEPARENT via `TraceContextPropagator`, attaches as current OTel context (leaked guard)\n2. All spans created by this process become children of the remote parent trace\n3. `current_traceparent()` extracts the current span context as a TRACEPARENT string for injection into child processes\n\n## What to implement\n\n1. Copy `telemetry.rs` module from botbox (ws/default/src/telemetry.rs)\n2. Add Cargo.toml deps (same as botbox — see description above)\n3. Call `telemetry::init()` at top of main(), hold guard until exit\n4. Add `#[instrument]` on: spawn, kill, send, tail, list operations\n5. Replace `eprintln!(\"Warning: ...\")` with `tracing::warn!(...)`\n6. **CRITICAL for botty**: When `botty spawn` creates child processes, inject TRACEPARENT from `current_traceparent()` into the child's environment. This is how the trace flows from hook → botty spawn → agent process. If TRACEPARENT is in `--env-inherit`, botty must forward it. If the caller passes `--env TRACEPARENT=...`, botty must set it in the child env.\n\nbotty is the key link in the distributed trace chain — it's the process that bridges botbus hooks to agent processes.","kind":"task","title":"Add TRACEPARENT distributed tracing support"}	blake3:HOpX-zvXylxLTUjr0dIAFfo7kPaxyBDJVn_uKAPcKiY
